# What `vercel deploy` from the repository root leaves out. The site (Root Directory `site` in the Vercel project)
# reads docs/, the changelog, Cargo.toml and files under crates/ from the root, and checks that every repo path a doc
# links to exists, so the rest of the tracked tree goes up. This mirrors .gitignore and site/.gitignore, since the
# Vercel CLI does not read them.
.git
.vercel
.cmx2
.DS_Store
/target
**/node_modules
**/*.snap.new
*.pending-snap
/crates/stetdoc-cli/tests/cmd/*.in/*.docx
/crates/stetdoc-cli/tests/cmd/*.out
/crates/stetdoc-cli/doc/*.in/*.docx
/crates/stetdoc-cli/doc/*.out
/site/.vercel
/site/.next
/site/out
/site/next-env.d.ts
/site/*.tsbuildinfo
/site/.impeccable/review
/site/public/docs
/site/public/docs.md
